            <ArticleTitle>Role of pain management programmes in chronic pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>35-40</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Many people in the UK experience chronic pain. This can have a huge effect on a person's life, including their mood, work and family. Pain management programmes are proving effective in helping people to cope with pain and improve their quality of life.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
